MewStage vendor patch core-bridge/0001 (third_party/NOTICE): a GPU-agnostic MEWUI_MEWVG_MEWSTAGE branch of the
MewVG IGraphicsContext bridge. The MewStage backend's partial (MewStageMewVGGraphicsContext) supplies a MewVGContext
subclass over the app's own GPU device; the branch also implements IGroupOpacityContext so Opacity < 1 composites
inside the one UI pass. The GL-only clear / blit path is compiled out so Clear() takes the fill path.
No behavioural change to the upstream branches.

